Muspector

Muspector source code is licensed under the Apache License 2.0. Interface icons
from Lucide are ISC licensed; attribution and the license text are in
assets/icons/LUCIDE.md. Rust dependencies retain their upstream licenses.

Muspector bundles ONNX conversions of the GFX Classifier model weights by
Marco Comunità and contributors. GFX Classifier is BSD-3-Clause licensed; its
copyright notice, license, provenance, and upstream links are retained in
models/gfx. The conversion changes the model container, not the learned
weights.

No GFX training dataset or source recording is bundled. Other model packages
supplied through a future muspector-models adapter remain separate works under
their own licenses and usage restrictions.
